  "title": "Rainfall (Telemetry - Hourly), Himachal Pradesh Department",
  "notes": "The Rainfall (Telemetry - Hourly) dataset, collected by the Himachal Pradesh Department, contains hourly rainfall measurements recorded through telemetry-based monitoring stations across various regions. Each record includes the timestamp, station identifier, geographic hierarchy, and recorded rainfall values, supporting real-time hydrological analysis, flood forecasting, water resource management, and climate studies at a national level.",
